	(gr_text "BLE U501 MDBT42T-P (nRF52805), SWD J501\n UART1 PB6/PB7, drives MCU BOOT0+NRST\nJ301 I2C PA8/9 INT PB14 SYNC PB15 CHN PA10\nJ302 UART2 PA2/PA3, UART4 PA0/PA1\nJ303 SPI2 SCK PB10 MOSI PB2 MISO PA7\nLED PB13/PB8 PWM, BTN PC15/PC13/PE2"
