	(gr_text "TIMETAKER CONTROL MODULE\nUSB-C 5V sink, 5.1k Rd, no PD\nVBUS 5V nom / 5.5V max, F401 0.75A PTC\nU401 TPD4S201: USB ESD + CC/SBU OVP\nU402 LDL1117S33R LDO -> DVDD_3V3\nU403 TPS22917 -> LANE_3V3, EN = PA6\nAll I/O 3.3V. PA1 is NOT 5V tolerant!\nMCU U201 STM32C542CCU6, 24MHz HSE\nSWD J201 TC2030. DFU: hold BOOT, tap RESET"
